				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<h3>Specifications</h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Types</td><td colspan="3">Round, oval, diamond, pleated.</td></tr><tr><td>Wire Diameter</td><td colspan="3">3.0/3.2/3.5/3.8/4.0/5.0mm.</td></tr><tr><td>Number of Wires</td><td colspan="3">8/10/12/16/20/24.</td></tr><tr><td>Ring Space</td><td colspan="3">6 inch or 8 inch.(15.24cm or 20.32cm)</td></tr><tr><td>Cage Diameter</td><td colspan="3">4 inch to 8 inch. (100mm to 200mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Wire Thickness</td><td colspan="3">2mm to 5mm.</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td colspan="3">Carbon Steel, Titanium Steel, Galvanized Steel, Stainless Steel.</td></tr><tr><td>Connection Methods</td><td colspan="3">Flanges, collars, or venturis.</td></tr><tr><td>Finishment</td><td colspan="3">Epoxy, silicon, PVC vinyl coating.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Common <strong>Filter Bag Cages</strong></h3><p><strong>There are many types of filter bag cages, which can be divided into the following main types according to their materials, structural design and surface treatment.</strong></p>						</div>
				</div>
